WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.710
If I've told you once...

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:04.640
...I've told you 1000 times:
watch from a safe distance away.

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.720
Did I get it right, Darling?

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:07.980
...yeah.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:27.580
Well?

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.890
No significant changes in environmental data,

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:32.140
magnetic flux, electromagnetic currents, etc...

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:34.940
Concerning the advancement to "C," there was

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:37.350
their first time browsing a bookstore and having ochazuke together, but...

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:41.250
...there has been no event that has
brought about a large emotional change.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:41.890
I see.

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:43.380
Does this trouble you?

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:45.010
I have no hard evidence,

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:47.630
but any changes in Rizel's
emotional amplitude have been...

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:49.650
...accompanied by changes
in the observed data.

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:53.790
As a scientist, that anomaly strikes me as odd.

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:30.750
It's Summer! It's the Beach! Go for the Legendary Kiss!?

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:33.810
Darling!

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:35.160
Huh? Whoa-

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:37.470
Oh, no! I'm sorry, Darling!

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.340
What's this about?!

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:41.790
Pamphlets for summer vacation destinations!

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:43.080
We don't <i>have</i>  any "destinations"!

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:45.540
But we haven't even been on our honeymoon.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:48.000
What do you mean, "honeymoon"?!

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:51.410
And the last summer of middle school
is our last chance!

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:53.090
Last chance for what?!

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:55.890
Yay! My first time being
rolled around like an egg!

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:58.680
So, what did you want to talk about?

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:02.320
Well, this is our final summer vacation, right?

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:06.190
So I kinda want to liven things up between me and my husband.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:10.190
Ah, that's how it usually is!
Well, you are 3rd-years, after all.

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:11.880
Were you the same way?

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:13.790
I sure was!

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:18.190
We had a lot of fun with
the Kissing Rocks legend!

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:19.540
"Kissing Rocks"?

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:22.180
My parents' home is near the sea...

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:25.320
There were two famous rocks there, known as the Kissing Rocks...

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:31.440
On only one day each summer,
the sun sets right between the Kissing Rocks.

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:35.630
Young people who have someone they like
stand on the outcropping facing the Kissing Rocks.

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:37.640
Both boys and girls?

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:39.050
That's right. And then...

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:43.190
...right when the setting sun reaches
the lips of the girl-rock and the boy-rock...

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:47.680
...everyone starts at once,
and before the sun completely sets...

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:50.600
...the first person to reach the legendary flower

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:54.030
at the top of the girl-rock is fated to be united with the one they love.

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.680
Did you do it, too?

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:59.200
No, somebody else chose me.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:02.990
And so, when the boy got the flower...

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:08.500
Hafun hafuun, that's so nice!

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:14.780
I'd so love to do something like that
with my husband, among other things...

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:18.140
Say, Sensei?
What did your first kiss taste like?

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:19.340
Well...

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:20.850
Did it taste like lemon?

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:23.640
It was the greatest way
to memorialize those days...

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:25.100
Is it sweet...?

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.270
Then again, we didn't actually do it.

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:30.140
I wonder what his kiss would taste like...

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:30.760
We made a movie of the race as a graduation project...

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:33.010
Oh, Darling, hafun...
We made a movie of the race as a graduation project...

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:37.060
It was really fun. Why don't you try something like that too?

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:39.660
Yeah! I want to do it!
I want to go to the Kissing Rocks!

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:43.120
I'm heading home for the summer break.
Would you like to come with me?

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:44.470
Yeah!

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:46.600
Yeah, right!

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:47.360
Isn't it?

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:48.740
Darling!

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:49.740
What is it?!

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:51.070
Yo, "Darling!"

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:51.870
Shaddap!

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:52.380
Later.
Shaddap!

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:52.780
Later.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:53.740
What do you want?

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:59.170
Well, there's this race where the winner is guaranteed a kiss from the one they love.

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:01.000
Let's go there for our honeymoon!

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.000
What're you talking about?

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:02.720
Whoa, that'd be amazing if it were true!
What're you talking about?

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:04.380
Whoa, that'd be amazing if it were true!

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:05.270
It <i>is</i>  true!

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:07.810
Who put that nonsense in your head?

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:09.850
Natsumi-sensei told me so!

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:15.180
She said she'd bring us to the race site,
since it's near her family's home!

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:16.880
The ball's in your court.

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:19.160
It has nothing to do with me!

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:20.720
Let's go, Darling!

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:24.020
Rizel-chan, let's leave this loser here
and go by ourselves!

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:27.700
Alas... Sensei -in a swimsuit-
might have even given you a kiss...

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:30.280
If you don't come with me, I'll cry!

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:33.340
Wait just a darned minute!
Don't cry in a place like this!!

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:35.450
Then, will you come with me?

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:37.200
All right, fine, you win...

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:38.510
Hurray!

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:41.680
I think I've gone soft lately...

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:51.600
What?! If I were to win, I could
have my way with my dear maiden?!

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:53.130
Is that true?!

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:54.840
Well done.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.780
Hey, did you see Ani-kun Night yesterday?

00:05:57.780 --> 00:05:58.930
Yeah, I saw it!

00:05:58.930 --> 00:06:02.760
My dear maiden... victory shall be mine.

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:06.730
And then I shall plant a loving kiss
upon those budding lips of yours...

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:11.330
What was your request again, Kyouko?

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:16.130
I feel very confused about some things.
But I can't remain a child forever...

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:17.660
W-What?

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:21.170
Father, please buy me
a one-piece swimsuit!

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:22.600
A swimsuit?! For YOU?!!

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:26.260
But you routinely skip gym class
because you're too embarrassed to swim!

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:28.250
You're right! Forget I said anything!

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:32.040
Don't be too hasty, now.
What made you want to do this?

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:35.880
Rizel-chan and the others are going to the beach for their summer break...

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:39.320
If I were to win the race that will be held there, then Iwaki-kun and I...

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:42.810
...could kiss, or maybe even do other,
unspeakable things...

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:43.990
I... I see...

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:45.570
Unspeakable things?

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:47.270
Like ****ing, or *****ing.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:50.940
But you don't even go to the same school.
How do you know about that?

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:54.630
I'm sorry... I just took it;
I couldn't help myself...

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:59.750
This is Daddy's miniature spy satellite terminal.

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:00.710
I'm sorry!

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:01.910
It's all right.

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:04.660
Anyway, there's no need for us
to buy you a swimsuit.

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:09.430
You bought yourself one
while you had your glasses off!

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:11.060
That's too racy for me!

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:12.670
NO! PLEASE USE THIS ONE!!

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:13.190
But-!
NO! PLEASE USE THIS ONE!!

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:15.650
DON'T DO SOMETHING UNLESS YOU'RE WILLING TO GO ALL THE WAY!!!

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:17.690
AND WHAT IF SHE SUCCEEDS?!?!

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:20.230
Kids sure grow up quickly...

00:07:20.230 --> 00:07:22.610
Don't hog all the poignant lines to yourself!

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:23.850
Rizel?

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:25.020
What's wrong?

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:28.200
I've been waiting.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:32.480
What's the point of me going?

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.420
She's not just taken,
she's <i>engaged,</i> damn it...

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:37.700
Rizel... what did you just say?

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:41.080
And if so, if I don't wind up
kissing my husband this summer,

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.500
I'll go back home.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:43.880
"Go back home"?!

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:47.340
The incident with Aoi-chan and
Ryuuzaburou-kun made me realize

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:51.720
that you have to be serious when it comes to love.
I've already made up my mind.

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:56.600
Rizel's "home" is...

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:58.310
...the research lab.

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:01.230
At any rate, we'd better
report this to our superiors.

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:08.120
Good morning, Iwaki-kun! You're coming
along with Rizel-chan and Aoi-san, right?

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:13.160
What, you mean you weren't planning to go?

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:15.620
It's pointless for me to go, anyway.

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:17.080
Hold it!

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:19.530
What makes you so sure?
Is it too much of a hassle?

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:22.830
Are you fine with not trying and never knowing?

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:24.660
You have to try, with all your might!

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:26.070
Sensei...

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:28.660
I'll be waiting.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:31.690
O-Okay...

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:32.930
Darling!

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:35.930
Hey, why'd you leave us behind?

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:38.510
I wanted to discuss the trip with you.

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:39.810
Good morning!

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:40.520
'Morning!

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:41.890
Good morning!

00:08:41.890 --> 00:08:42.930
Good morning to you, too!

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:43.850
Were we interrupting?

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:44.730
Shut up.

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:47.140
Ah! Darling! Wait!

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:48.370
Listen to me, Darling!

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:49.460
You should all make a wonderful movie of your own.
Listen to me, Darling!

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.650
You should all make a wonderful movie of your own.

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:03.960
Mama A, we sent a report on the situation in an earlier communiquﾃｩ, but...

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:06.130
The situation is serious.

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:08.760
What do you make of Rizel, the original Proto-Mankind,

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:11.440
saying that she will "return home"?

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.190
Well...

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:15.010
She intends to voluntarily suspend her own life functions

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:17.200
and return to her dormant state!

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:20.280
If that happens, this project is doomed!

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:24.190
I think you're blowing this out of proporti-!

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:26.350
Your ignorance is truly mind-boggling!

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:27.310
That hurt...

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:27.670
What was that for?!
That hurt...

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:28.710
What was that for?!

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:33.990
You all have forgotten the most important fact.

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:38.460
Do you know how important the decision to kiss someone can be for a girl?!

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:41.500
And how shocking it is
to be denied that chance?

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:43.960
A kiss is just a gesture of greeting in the West, you know-

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:50.870
Can a man even comprehend a girl's suffering
when she is denied a kiss by her loved one?

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:52.050
Me and my big mouth...

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:54.410
Have you forgotten the
hard beginnings of this project?

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:59.040
We did anything and everything to awaken her, but Rizel always fell right back "asleep."

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:03.860
Yet upon contact with Iwaki Tomonori,
she spontaneously activated of her own free will.

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:07.990
Her relationship with Iwaki Tomonori is vital to the project!

00:10:07.990 --> 00:10:11.310
Rizel and Iwaki Tomonori must be made to kiss, at any cost.

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:13.980
And without <i>any</i>  hints of intervention.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:15.520
Yes, ma'am.

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.160
Having said that...

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:24.960
...we've sent forth many Proto-Mankind copies,

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:28.270
...but none of them has managed to kiss
a member of the opposite sex.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:33.680
Furthermore, what will happen
when Rizel <i>does</i>  achieve that goal?

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:35.430
Summer Vacation 笙･

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:37.840
Is everybody here?

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:38.850
Yes!

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:40.770
All right, number off! One!

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:42.080
Two!

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:43.460
Three!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.770
Why do we have to do this? Four.

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:46.690
Five!

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:49.970
Hey, aren't you Yachigusa-san?
Didn't you graduate?

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:51.910
Sorry to just butt in like this...

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:53.180
What's <i>she</i>  doing here?

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:54.910
My, fancy meeting you here!

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:56.150
R-Ry-Ryu-Ryuu-

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:56.950
Ryuutarou-kun!

00:10:56.950 --> 00:11:00.690
It's <i>Ryuunosuke,</i> my dear maiden.
This is quite a coincidence, isn't it?

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:02.330
Yeah, a <i>contrived</i>  coincidence!

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:05.320
Excellent! I shall go along with you as well!

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:06.500
Six!

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:08.160
What the hell was that?!

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:11.040
W-We're pleased to have you along!

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:15.890
I mainly came along to support Rizel-chan,
but this might be the perfect chance for me!

00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:17.850
Okay, let's go!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.250
Yeah!!

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:21.090
Yes! We're off!!

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:22.080
Rizel-chan, wait!

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:22.810
My dear maiden!
Rizel-chan, wait!

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:23.570
Running is dangerous!
My dear maiden!

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:24.630
Running is dangerous!

00:11:25.520 --> 00:11:27.590
How could this happen to me?

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:37.030
Look this way!

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:37.390
Yes!

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:38.150
Peace!
Yes!

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:38.530
Peace!

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:42.710
We've come pretty far. Are we there yet?

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:44.330
Just a little bit farther!

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:46.880
But aren't we heading into the mountains?

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:48.880
Don't worry, it's inside the city limits.

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:50.040
We've made it!

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:50.860
Okay, next we take the bus!
We've made it!

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:52.220
Okay, next we take the bus!

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:54.250
Sensei, how much farther is it?

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:55.010
Just a bit farther; it's within the city limits.
Sensei, how much farther is it?

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:56.100
Just a bit farther; it's within the city limits.

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:57.700
Sensei! How much farther could it be?

00:11:57.700 --> 00:11:58.400
It's within the city limits!
Sensei! How much farther could it be?

00:11:58.400 --> 00:11:59.260
It's within the city limits!

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:02.390
If we were going to be using a plane,
we should have just <i>flown</i>  there!

00:12:02.390 --> 00:12:03.760
But we're not leaving the city!

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:05.410
Of what city?!

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:07.310
This is where we get off!

00:12:07.640 --> 00:12:09.190
Don't get separated!

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:10.870
No way!

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:12.190
Skydiving?!
No way!

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:12.290
Yay!
Skydiving?!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:12.820
Yay!

00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:13.560
Oh, my!

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:14.440
What the heck?!

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:16.090
Let's dive!

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:17.420
My dear maiden!

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:18.120
If Ryuunosuke-kun's gonna do it...!
My dear maiden!

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:19.270
If Ryuunosuke-kun's gonna do it...!

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:22.070
There's no definition of "inside the city limits"
that includes <i>this!</i>

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:24.480
Why don't we head back, just the two of us?

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:26.120
W-Wait! Stop! Whoa... hey!!

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.990
Oh! I'm scared!!
W-Wait! Stop! Whoa... hey!!

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:28.000
W-Wait! Stop! Whoa... hey!!

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:31.910
Why did it turn out like this?!

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:38.040
WHY?!?!?!

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:11.490
I've found you, Darling!

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:12.910
Don't just pop up out of nowhere!

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:15.620
But, but... aren't married couples supposed to stay together?

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:16.610
Like I'd know!

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:18.670
Oh, Darling. You're so shy!

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:19.960
That's it, I'm outta here.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:23.840
Ah!! Wait, wait! Don't leave me, Darling!

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.210
I've found you, Darling!

00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:30.340
Don't just pop up out of nowhere!

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:33.670
But, but... aren't married couples supposed to stay together?

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:35.240
Like I'd know!

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:37.120
Oh, Darling. You're so shy!

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:38.620
Quit making stuff up!

